---
// Inline SVG on purpose: the site CSP blocks <style>/style="", and token classes
// (fill-bg, stroke-fg, fill-accent…) follow the theme toggle. Public-safe labels only.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 380 730" class="block h-auto w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-req-title arch-req-desc" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <title id="arch-req-title">Path of one public HTTPS request</title>
  <desc id="arch-req-desc">Nine steps: DNS to the cloud edge, TLS passthrough, a PROXY header over the encrypted tunnel, the firewall rule that only allows the ingress address, the MetalLB address with a Local traffic policy, Traefik terminating TLS with the real client IP, the router or LAN-only guard, the service and pod, and finally CloudNativePG.</desc>
  <defs>
    <marker id="arch-req-ah" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="fill-fg" />
    </marker>
    <marker id="arch-req-ah-acc" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="fill-accent" />
    </marker>
  </defs>
  <path d="M22,24 L22,664" fill="none" class="stroke-accent" stroke-width="3" />
  <rect x="44" y="8" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="28" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">DNS</text>
  <text x="54" y="46" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">A record points at the cloud</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">edge, never at home.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="24" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="29" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
  <rect x="44" y="88" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="108" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Cloud edge</text>
  <text x="54" y="126" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">Passes TLS through untouched;</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">plain HTTP only for ACME.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="104" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="109" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
  <rect x="44" y="168" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="188" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">PROXY header + tunnel</text>
  <text x="54" y="206" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">Prepends the client IP, then</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">WireGuard to the gateway.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="184" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="189" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
  <rect x="44" y="248" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="268" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Firewall allow rule</text>
  <text x="54" y="286" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">Tunnel may reach the ingress</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">IP and nothing else.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="264" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="269" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">4</text>
  <rect x="44" y="328" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="348" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Load-balancer IP</text>
  <text x="54" y="366" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">MetalLB; Local traffic policy</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">keeps the source address.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="344" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="349" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">5</text>
  <rect x="44" y="408" width="326" height="68" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="428" class="font-sans fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Traefik terminates TLS</text>
  <text x="54" y="446" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">Let's Encrypt cert. Trusts the</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">PROXY header only from the tunnel.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="424" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="429" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">6</text>
  <rect x="44" y="488" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="508" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Router or LAN-only guard</text>
  <text x="54" y="526" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">Internal hostnames 404 for</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">anyone outside the LAN.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="504" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="509" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">7</text>
  <rect x="44" y="568" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="588" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Service → pod</text>
  <text x="54" y="606" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">Overlay network across nodes,</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">GPU worker included.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="584" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="589" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">8</text>
  <rect x="44" y="648" width="326" height="68" class="fill-bg stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="54" y="668" class="font-sans fill-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700">Pod → Postgres</text>
  <text x="54" y="686" class="font-mono fill-muted" font-size="11"><tspan x="54" dy="0">CloudNativePG primary, with</tspan><tspan x="54" dy="15">replicas and backups behind it.</tspan></text>
  <circle cx="22" cy="664" r="13" class="fill-accent stroke-fg" stroke-width="2" />
  <text x="22" y="669" class="font-mono fill-accent-fg" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">9</text>
</svg>
